{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-34","kind":"proposition","title":"设圆求割一分而负圆分角与所设直线角等","englishTitle":"From a given circle to cut off a segment admitting an angle equal to a given rectilineal angle.","book":3,"number":34,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.34","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.34/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":34,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-34@raw-d48400cbfdbd05a3","contentId":"euclid-3-34","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d48400cbfdbd05a3f0164644e2fa20fd2e0705ac43fd817064724d8ac95651ac","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-34.statement","euclid-3-34.construction.1","euclid-3-34.construction.2","euclid-3-34.proof.1","euclid-3-34.proof.2","euclid-3-34.conclusion","euclid-3-34.historical.1","euclid-3-34.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-34.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-34","revisionId":"euclid-3-34@raw-d48400cbfdbd05a3","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"06d791080764a926bc3497d73d9cf7ffe6245b7c47c99a30b01c6f37c9ad8a18","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"From a given circle to cut off a segment admitting an angle equal to a given rectilineal angle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从给定的圆圈切除一个部分, 其角度等于给定的直角 。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"设圜求割一分而负圜分角与所设直线角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让圆被分为一份，负弧角等于所设置直线的角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-34.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-34","revisionId":"euclid-3-34@raw-d48400cbfdbd05a3","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ecc9b59176064a3e4eb4dcc9c266eb10fc94ce23bbb3202a2050501a1094067","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be the given circle, and the angle at D the given rectilineal angle; thus it is required to cut off from the circle ABC a segment admitting an angle equal to the given rectilineal angle, the angle at D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC是给定的圆,让D角为给定的直线角;因此,需要将一个部分从圆上切除ABC,其中一个部分的角等于给定的直线角,即D角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-34.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-3-34","revisionId":"euclid-3-34@raw-d48400cbfdbd05a3","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fdb241661587b7a850d595a4db2ffb5820f53622e80035aae41d7a2ec544324c","citations":["euclid-1-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let EF be drawn touching ABC at the point B, and on the straight line FB, and at the point B on it, let the angle FBC be constructed equal to the angle at D. [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"绘制EF幅,触摸B点的ABC幅,直线FB,在B点,使FBC角等于D角。 [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-34.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-34","revisionId":"euclid-3-34@raw-d48400cbfdbd05a3","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f4ecd7013d2fc8ed2eebadf8eb8663c044b02d44dd50758054b53e5103e8c13b","citations":["euclid-3-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since a straight line EF touches the circle ABC, and BC has been drawn across from the point of contact at B, the angle FBC is equal to the angle constructed in the alternate segment BAC. [[III. 32](/principles/euclid-3-32)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,由于直线EF直线触及ABC圆,BC是从B接触点对面划出的,角度FBC等于在替代部分BAC中构造的角。 [[III. 32](/principles/euclid-3-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-34.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-34","revisionId":"euclid-3-34@raw-d48400cbfdbd05a3","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2626b19162207f067cf3894f2ae9fe77bcb5cd29fd956b275fe9a858c730b7c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle FBC is equal to the angle at D; therefore the angle in the segment BAC is equal to the angle at D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但角度FBC等于角度D,因此,部分BAC的角度等于角度D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-34.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-34","revisionId":"euclid-3-34@raw-d48400cbfdbd05a3","order":5,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e669cad4e571876d6b26b0890400abf01654f3e09a79bacc1a66648e0f8767ac","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore from the given circle ABC the segment BAC. has been cut off admitting an angle equal to the given rectilineal angle, the angle at D. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,从给定的ABC圆中,第BAC段被切断,其中的角等于给定的直角,角为D,Q,E,F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-34.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-34","revisionId":"euclid-3-34@raw-d48400cbfdbd05a3","order":6,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4fa20b227cb676df1b778f705f1622b769b201896ba5eba79ae41a5ac69b5fee","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"设圜求割一分而负圜分角与所设直线角等法曰设甲乙丙圜求割一分而负圜分角与丁等先作戊己直线切圜于甲〈本篇十七〉次作已甲乙角与丁等即割圜之甲乙线上所作甲丙乙角负甲丙乙圜分而与丁等何者已甲乙角与丁等亦与甲丙乙交互相等故〈本篇〉〈卅二〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让圆被一部分划分，负弧角和设定的直角如下：设 甲乙丙 为一个圆，负弧角等于 丁，依此类推，先画 戊己 并切 甲〈本篇十七〉 该圆到 戊己，然后画 甲乙 角和 丁，即 甲丙乙 角在直线 甲乙 上是减去 甲丙乙 弧和 丁，依此类推，因此 甲乙 和 丁 也交替等于 甲丙乙 〈本篇〉〈卅二〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-34.source","contentId":"euclid-3-34","revisionId":"euclid-3-34@raw-d48400cbfdbd05a3","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8a4b4d51944467dfef615f1c04406cdbfa8ee2deb8a75c1d1e8251f49aa2d497","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.34/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.34\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-34:euclid-1-23:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-34","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-34.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-23","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.34","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.34/","sourceLabel":"I. 23"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-34:euclid-3-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-34","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-34.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.34","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.34/","sourceLabel":"III. 32"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-34:euclid-1-23:explicit","id":"euclid-1-23","book":1,"number":23,"kind":"proposition","title":"在给定点复制一个角","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-34:euclid-3-32:explicit","id":"euclid-3-32","book":3,"number":32,"kind":"proposition","title":"弦切角定理","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-circle","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
